+    ),
+    PARROT_FOLLOW_TARGET_SCANS(
+        "performance.entity-queries.parrot-follow-target-scans",
+        "鹦鹉寻找跟随目标时找到目标后停止搜索，关闭后查询完整列表。默认：true。"
